	"data": "Module 6: API Layer — Implementation Detail\n\nPart of the Custom RAG Pipeline. See custom-rag-pipeline.md for the full system map.\n\nOverview\n\nM6 is the interface layer — it makes M2-M5 accessible to humans and agents. Three surfaces:\nCLI (vault_rag.py) — direct command-line access for search, ingest, status\nOpenClaw Skill — so Calcifer (and subagents) can call the pipeline via natural language\nOpenClaw memory_search replacement — long-term goal: route OpenClaw's built-in memory search through…",
